# Freezone Express (main store API) — browser origin only, no `/api` suffix.
# Local (Vite proxies /api to 4000): leave unset or use:
#   VITE_API_URL=http://127.0.0.1:4000
# Netlify production (example):
#   VITE_API_URL=https://api.example.com
#
# If unset at build time, production defaults to https://freezone-website.fly.dev (same as storefront).
# Set VITE_API_URL explicitly when your API lives elsewhere.
#
# Commerce admin-api (Nest) — base MUST include `/v1` (Offers / sub-services).
#   VITE_COMMERCE_API_BASE_URL=https://commerce-admin-api.fly.dev/v1
# Alias also read by `commerce-api.ts`:
#   VITE_API_BASE_URL=https://commerce-admin-api.fly.dev/v1
#
# Local commerce dev:
# VITE_COMMERCE_API_BASE_URL=http://127.0.0.1:3020/v1
# VITE_API_BASE_URL=http://127.0.0.1:3020/v1
